{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_0ee1877b255298700fc3ceab20ffa98073ad6bd574c91d49654b0c572b04179a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5e05c9f91cc79f2b6ff29845cf33a64dde4207606db012c988c12290bc6aef4a"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162"],"text":"The project positions itself for agents needing real-time situational awareness, semantic search over structured event streams, and quick prototypes with built-in temporal decay and deduplication.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_172ff492b6da7011519f6f386e6da314825e9c1fe8172b12c6515ce5a5beed24","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8182a42c6b3f78c0813af6ec133ad43810a1f0130cdf6c9df8c8763a738c1a1e","slc_a16f72a77041ae677cb568abf837e9aae98cc70c1170c1caeef8d6c4d83a986b","slc_df215a933696329ef43266f82745505421b56f19046a47ffe81eae01bdb37704"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162"],"text":"Default embeddings use TF-IDF with locality-sensitive hashing projected to 128 dimensions, deterministic and network-free; an optional OpenAI text-embedding-3-small provider offers 1536-dimensional semantic search.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3375bd7d96c37283510074684d048f80fb8eadb3e7139066606bd023050a3f76","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_736d0b49dd8df601b6b58e31e4493af9f630b381d5573d07e941a0434db656e1","slc_869588304939aa62e56d6665196ab223419bee542a7ffda89b47491e5717afe7"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162"],"text":"The README reports benchmarks on Apple Silicon with local TF-IDF and in-memory SQLite: roughly 0.1ms per ingest, 0.1ms per query across 1000 events, and about 20MB heap.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_393e16452ac0102fa33cdb383582e16a025092145c30b744f6bf2ffb51581cfd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_22c767556ecafb53f72ffdf459a6920fc342f1bbd2c29371186a402e12df2f64"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors clone the repo, run npm install, npm run build to compile TypeScript, npm test for the test suite, and npm run dev for watch mode.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_62ac101334cc26dc67708e0ca602d248c3ffd7410fed72b2908d6e438b4343df","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3dadd36ef67aa6bbc36a88465640d24efffaa8ca3911eabc53246ffbff41a3db","slc_eee6aba16e1ed3ba010aa2ff37368bc35ea910c7c8910fea8a889db0eb68b09b"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162"],"text":"An MCP server example lets MCP-compatible clients such as Claude Desktop, Cursor, and Windsurf call ingest_event, query_context, get_recent, and clear_context as native tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a834fc855c29950e54cd13bb89643557b957fc3492d8223c4ce589c95dcb712b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_893762d862b93b36917689d86139bdeba70a2ecb9e17829ff809087af7a2b42d","slc_eab9fe2688d0ea7dd4b1f403b4901ec8849c3e2541929cbebba8f7847370734a"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162"],"text":"The npm package context-engine-ai lets AI agents ingest events from any source and query them in natural language, returning ranked, time-decayed results without a vector database, API keys, or configuration.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c3e0f3cecb7c769c587ee060ea186b6ee29890340a1e1adf613b58012535a04a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b6690c94da9e4a7f636391e7f31ff897108dbe64a806914207e42720244eee8c","slc_c6a0bba871e4265b85cf7b2dacb17c1776aa19395f3af27c596e22de7ae4eb60","slc_cdd1a49a76f15d1c75fd96c647fbba77bb4d9190ad6a526731534865d2f53513","slc_e047bce99a06d69ab7c441c4613f50e456de709512f61d1e5296c23ec5f4dabc"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162","src_c9d358687d7e5041944a558ebba23e23"],"text":"Query ranking multiplies cosine similarity by relevance and an exponential half-life decay factor 0.5^(age/halfLife), with a configurable decayHours defaulting to 24 hours.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c80934970d1b411abe7318837ce23bd19b65bd4e2444b9ecc746e350818a20e4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_517f8a7a8a9f69452063460be82710a62fae00db77f0d2a7aed451deae4043b6","slc_eee6dab17965d79fda6cd39d9bf530b8120469389d3944aff99ed5681b1773fd"],"source_ids":["src_c9d358687d7e5041944a558ebba23e23"],"text":"Storage adapters include SQLiteStorage built on better-sqlite3 with brute-force JS cosine search suited to roughly 10,000 events, and PostgresStorage using pgvector's cosine-distance operator for production scale.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c925389e44174a63b1ec3ee249137b688005b76fa8d38638435e34281f21adcf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0bb484145aa81de978e95b6b1dff48e7838b8ef77ceb3f060891b287e5297752","slc_9654590c99a2b7942ad390b3535b5d957fe14405d81cc32c8dc74c36d093854e","slc_a678e637f9ed7c634d5da35d30dcbfb44c3215ec0f6be2f0b969e220129b89de"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162"],"text":"The HTTP server mode exposes REST endpoints including POST /ingest, GET /context?q=..., GET /recent, GET /count, DELETE /events, and GET /health, startable via ctx.serve(3334) or an npx CLI command.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d1c9ea2c49ed3db2b097bb569eecc7c5e2290c8818bf50b1dbcb221bfd8fed4f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2c586f6971cdae6c6263a21e99c3380cb61f18ecd3fa8a4982397637f2b8d639"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162"],"text":"Requirements are Node.js >= 18 with no external services in default configuration; PostgreSQL with the pgvector extension and an OpenAI API key are optional for production scale and higher-quality embeddings.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d45a47f23e8857fcadb8367e30be2c8eae6ca6ed5cf4bd0fabe7c64048406dbc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8166f13298808bcdee5e156a72b989b561022c094250998372ff70f9fea50ca9"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162"],"text":"The README states the tool is not the right fit for searching large documents or PDFs, for months-long persistent memory, or for indexing millions of documents, suggesting RAG frameworks or dedicated vector databases instead.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d70d0317c3cd9762ab4916376e83f6bae00080a6381467626055aedb2db5ffdc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_63a8fd5e2afd959b259db14e3edda012f0e889b5f1ab1f2b4a2347a1bd433c2d","slc_b6690c94da9e4a7f636391e7f31ff897108dbe64a806914207e42720244eee8c","slc_d0ee6f8fb2b4413492d6497588abe058076c4eee9c42a25d1b2310ac8174ea1c","slc_e8927274f995dbf89b5cf12e28b0f18550aaf0d05b5c196488ee93082498b0ce"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162","src_c9d358687d7e5041944a558ebba23e23"],"text":"Ingest deduplicates events whose cosine similarity exceeds a configurable threshold (default 0.95) within a time window (default 60s), merging timestamps, boosting relevance, and tracking a _mergeCount field.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","created_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ed3a3be63b906075cb697552bc7f8c1f44a5bf1d5b1cf016a9fe43b4859d0b50","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"quinnod345/context-engine@ff40183c8225 snapshot 0674eb88612e7123","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8512aea0ee7da088b2dd208ea116d39d96d8225008ee70b17bfceedb12d7e1a7","slc_ff2a5dd2423495abfce406f24d629a1b9dd3c6663d7746d30cb387e2f08adb9e"],"source_ids":["src_2249690a32225f4ba85618e6a039b162"],"text":"By default the engine runs in-memory with events lost on restart; passing dbPath persists events to a standard SQLite file that survives restarts and can be inspected with SQLite tools.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:17:15Z","updated_by_operation":"op_02cdb06a8ba24ea09df01eb813e9795d"}
